Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4a0fd1b8-ed8a-d04b-a333-78153d9a0237"],

Cell["\<\
In solid-state NMR under magic-angle spinning (MAS) at spinning rate nu_r = \
1/T_r, anisotropic interactions such as dipolar couplings and chemical-shift \
anisotropy (CSA) become periodically time-dependent: H_0(t + T_r) = H_0(t). \
Designing recoupling pulses across rotor periods requires fourth-order \
integration of H_0(t) inside every RF slice alongside ensemble averaging over \
unknown crystallite rotor starting phases t0.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aaea93f2-8848-0e4e-a7d4-276227560b8d"],

Cell["\<\
Construct continuous time-dependent drifts via SpinDynamica's \
PeriodicFunction.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d456796d-7866-6d41-bca9-df0d387a7093"],

Cell["\<\
Compare DriftIntegration accuracy across Midpoint, SubSlices, CF4 \
(GaussLegendre2), and refined CF4x2 / CF4x4 schemes.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3eb7dacb-e59a-ad47-bd4e-4d045e9474f9"],

Cell["\<\
Verify analytical CF4 gradients against central finite differences.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8270a008-4fb0-ee40-b32d-dce5b8f07449"],

Cell["\<\
Optimise rotor-phase-invariant dipolar recoupling (sweeping InitialTimePoint \
-> t0Sym) and feed the result into Signal1D \"COMPUTE\".\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"24487b50-b8e1-5d47-8b7e-2983642ed63c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Mathematical Background", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5aad6be1-42c5-f242-8a1f-018b7eb9b6c7"],

Cell["\<\
On each piecewise-constant control slice [t_{j-1}, t_j) of width h = dt_j, \
default DriftIntegration -> \"CF4\" (fourth-order two-stage Commutator-Free \
Magnus integrator) evaluates H_0(t) once during compilation at Gauss-Legendre \
nodes t_{1,2} = t_{j-1} + h (1/2 -/+ Sqrt[3]/6) and advances by U_{j} = \
U_{j,2} U_{j,1} using weights w_+- = 1/2 +/- Sqrt[3]/3.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6f224063-9844-324b-8e06-090359b92825"],

Cell["\<\
All five GRAPE kernels operate transparently over N_fine = N_t * nStages fine \
stages while broadcasting constant RF amplitudes u_{j,k}. Note carefully: \
Signal1D[..., SignalCalculationMethod -> \"COMPUTE\"] accelerates periodic \
acquisition under static events ({None, dur}), whereas GRAPEOptimize handles \
active shaped RF irradiation using CF4 time-domain propagation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1c0b5b83-081b-d547-9642-c4393f84af12"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Worked Example", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"78f8fa95-29d3-bb42-ac44-f742f9bdf765"],

Cell["\<\
Execute Tutorial 09: build a 10 kHz (T_r = 100 us) MAS dipolar + CSA \
Hamiltonian Hdip via PeriodicFunction, measure propagator convergence vs \
CF4x4, check CF4 gradient accuracy, optimise a 4-rotor-phase invariant \
recoupling pulse over 2 T_r, and verify both VerifyOptimalControlSimulation \
and post-pulse Signal1D \"COMPUTE\" vs \"Direct\".\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"89fefc66-9a48-214d-9b6a-4fd5911acf3b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetSpinSystem", "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"b2", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ZeemanBasis", "[", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ctrls4", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<y\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<y\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"trMAS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"1.", "/", "10000."}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"wr", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"2.", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Pi", " ", "/", " ", "trMAS"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Hdip", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"PeriodicFunction", "[", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "trMAS", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1500.", " ", "*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"3500.", " ", "*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
          RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"4000.", " ", "*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
          RowBox[{"wr", " ", "t"}], "]"}], " ", "*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}], " ", "+", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"6000.", " ", "*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
            RowBox[{"wr", " ", "t"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
           RowBox[{"0.5", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
             RowBox[{"2", " ", "wr", " ", "t"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", "*", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"2", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}], ".", 
             RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
              RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
             RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}], ".", 
            RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
             RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
             RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<y\>\""}], "]"}], ".", 
            RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
             RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<y\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], "\n",
        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"1.", " ", "Quadrature", " ", "convergence"}], " ", "&"}], " ", 
    "CF4", " ", "gradient", " ", "check"}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "90", "]"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"uProbe", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"RandomReal", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "3000."}], ",", " ", "3000."}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"12", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"props", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"AssociationThread", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Midpoint\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<SubSlices4\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<CF4\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<CF4x2\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<CF4x4\>\""}], "}"}], " ", "->", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s", ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"EvaluateOptimalControl", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"OptimalControlProblem", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Hdip", ",", " ", "ctrls4", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"StateTarget", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
                RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
              "\n", "    ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"2.", " ", "*", " ", "trMAS"}], ",", " ", "12"}], 
               "}"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"InitialTimePoint", " ", "->", " ", 
               RowBox[{"trMAS", "/", "4."}]}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"FrequencyUnits", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hz\>\""}], ",", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{"ControlUnits", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hz\>\""}], ",", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{"DriftIntegration", " ", "->", " ", "s"}]}], "]"}], ",",
             "\n", "    ", "uProbe"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<FinalPropagator\>\"", 
          "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Midpoint\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<SubSlices\>\"", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}], ",", 
         " ", "\"\<CF4\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<CF4\>\"", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<CF4\>\"", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"convErrs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
       RowBox[{"#", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"props", "[", "\"\<CF4x4\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
     "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"KeyDrop", "[", 
     RowBox[{"props", ",", " ", "\"\<CF4x4\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"gradCF4", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"VerifyOptimalControlGradient", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"OptimalControlProblem", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Hdip", ",", " ", "ctrls4", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"StateTarget", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2.", " ", "*", " ", "trMAS"}], ",", " ", "12"}], "}"}], ",",
         " ", 
        RowBox[{"InitialTimePoint", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"trMAS", "/", "4."}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"FrequencyUnits", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hz\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ControlUnits", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hz\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"DriftIntegration", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<CF4\>\""}]}], "]"}], 
      ",", "\n", "  ", "uProbe", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"StepSize", " ", "->", " ", "0.05"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
  "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2.", " ", "4"}], "-", "Rotor", "-", 
       RowBox[{
       "phase", " ", "invariant", " ", "dipolar", " ", "recoupling"}]}], " ", 
      "&"}], " ", "post"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"pulse", " ", "Signal1D", " ", "COMPUTE", " ", "check"}]}], " ", 
   "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ensMAS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"OptimalControlEnsemble", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Hdip", ",", " ", "ctrls4", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"StateTarget", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
        RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2.", " ", "*", " ", "trMAS"}], ",", " ", "24"}], "}"}], ",", 
     "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"EnsembleParameters", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"t0Sym", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"trMAS", "/", "4."}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"trMAS", "/", "2."}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"3.", " ", "*", " ", 
           RowBox[{"trMAS", "/", "4."}]}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
     "  ", 
     RowBox[{"InitialTimePoint", " ", "->", " ", "t0Sym"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FrequencyUnits", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hz\>\""}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ControlUnits", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hz\>\""}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"DriftIntegration", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<CF4\>\"", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"resMAS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"GRAPEOptimize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ensMAS", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"AmplitudeNormBound", " ", "->", " ", "18000."}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TargetFidelity", " ", "->", " ", "0.995"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"MaxIterations", " ", "->", " ", "140"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"RandomSeed", " ", "->", " ", "77"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"simMAS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"VerifyOptimalControlSimulation", "[", 
    RowBox[{"resMAS", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Tolerance", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "5"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"rhoAfter", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"NPropagate", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"OptimalControlEventList", "[", 
       RowBox[{"resMAS", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"IncludeDrift", " ", "->", " ", "False"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Basis", " ", "->", " ", "b2"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"BackgroundGenerator", " ", "->", " ", "Hdip"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"InitialTimePoint", " ", "->", " ", "0."}]}], "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"opI", "[", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
